#: ../developer/sso.md:1
msgid "Single Sign-On"
msgstr "单点登录（SSO）"

#: ../developer/sso.md:3
msgid ""
"This page is for an operator who wants an organization's members to sign "
"in to the console with the organization's own accounts. The gateway "
"supports OpenID Connect identity providers; SAML and CAS are not "
"supported."
msgstr "本页面向这样的运维人员：希望组织成员用组织自己的账号登录控制台。网关支持 OpenID Connect 身份提供方；不支持 SAML 和 CAS。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:7
msgid "Connect a provider"
msgstr "对接一个身份提供方"

#: ../developer/sso.md:9
msgid ""
"**Register the gateway at the identity provider** as a confidential "
"client using the authorization code flow, with the redirect URI "
"`<FRONTEND_URL>/auth/sso/<id>/callback`. `<id>` is the short name you "
"give the provider in the next step. Note the client id and secret."
msgstr ""
"**在身份提供方注册网关**，作为使用授权码流程的机密客户端，回调地址设为 "
"`<FRONTEND_URL>/auth/sso/<id>/callback`。`<id>` 是下一步中为该提供方起的短名称。记下 client "
"id 和 secret。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:13
msgid ""
"**Describe the provider** in the `SSO_PROVIDERS` setting, under **Admin →"
" Settings → Site & Setup → Advanced settings → Application**:"
msgstr ""
"**描述这个身份提供方**：在 **Admin → Settings → Site & Setup → Advanced settings → "
"Application** 中，填写 `SSO_PROVIDERS` 设置："

#: ../developer/sso.md:30
msgid "`client_secret` names a secret setting, never the secret itself."
msgstr "`client_secret` 写的是一个秘密设置项的名字，而不是 secret 本身。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:31
msgid ""
"**Store the client secret.** Saving the provider adds the setting it "
"names, here `SSO_EXAMPLE_UNIV_CLIENT_SECRET`, under **Admin → Settings → "
"Access & Limits**, in the **Security** section. Enter the secret there."
msgstr ""
"**保存 client secret**。保存身份提供方之后，它引用的那个设置（这里是 "
"`SSO_EXAMPLE_UNIV_CLIENT_SECRET`）会出现在 **Admin → Settings → Access & "
"Limits** 的 **Security** 部分。在那里填入密钥。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:35
msgid "**Restart the gateway.** It reads the secret at startup."
msgstr "**重启网关。** 网关在启动时读取 secret。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:36
msgid ""
"**Check `FRONTEND_URL`.** It must be the address users open the console "
"at: the redirect URI is built from it, and a sign-in completes only "
"through that address."
msgstr "**检查 `FRONTEND_URL`。** 它必须是用户打开控制台时使用的地址：回调地址由它生成，登录也只有经由这个地址才能完成。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:39
msgid ""
"**Check which host the console calls the gateway on.** The sign-in's "
"cookies must reach both that host and the host of `FRONTEND_URL`. A "
"console built with an empty `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE` calls its own host, "
"and nothing more is needed. When `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE` names another "
"host, set `COOKIE_DOMAIN` to a domain that covers both. Two ports on "
"`localhost` are one host for cookies."
msgstr ""
"**检查控制台在哪个主机上调用网关。** 登录过程中的 cookie 必须同时能到达该主机和 `FRONTEND_URL` 所在的主机。构建时 "
"`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE` 为空的控制台调用的是自己的主机，无需其他设置。若 `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE` "
"指向另一个主机，请把 `COOKIE_DOMAIN` 设为能同时覆盖两者的域。对 cookie 而言，`localhost` "
"上的两个端口是同一个主机。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:46
msgid ""
"The sign-in page shows **Log in with SSO** once the provider is saved; "
"until the secret is stored and the gateway restarted, it reports that "
"single sign-on is unavailable. A user enters their work or school email "
"and is sent to the provider whose `domains` cover it. The page does not "
"list connected organizations."
msgstr ""
"提供方保存后，登录页就会显示 **Log in with SSO**；在 secret 存好并重启网关之前，它会提示 SSO "
"登录不可用。用户输入工作或学校邮箱后，会被转到 `domains` 覆盖该邮箱的提供方。登录页不会列出已接入的组织。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:52
msgid ""
"Later changes to `SSO_PROVIDERS` apply without a restart; a changed "
"client secret needs one. Saving either asks the administrator to confirm "
"who they are (see [Confirming sensitive actions](#confirming-sensitive-"
"actions))."
msgstr ""
"之后修改 `SSO_PROVIDERS` 无需重启；修改 client secret "
"需要重启。保存这两个设置项时，都会要求管理员确认身份（见[确认敏感操作](#confirming-sensitive-actions)）。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:56
msgid "Provider fields"
msgstr "身份提供方的字段"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`id`"
msgstr "`id`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "required"
msgstr "必填"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"Short name: lower-case letters, digits and hyphens. It is part of the "
"redirect URI, so changing it means changing the redirect URI at the "
"provider too. Keep the provider's `domains` when you change its `id`, and"
" its links follow it"
msgstr ""
"短名：小写字母、数字和连字符。它是重定向 URI 的一部分，改名后也要修改身份提供方那边登记的重定向 URI。修改 `id` 时保持该身份提供方的"
" `domains` 不变，它的关联就会跟着过来"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`type`"
msgstr "`type`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "The protocol. Only `oidc` is accepted"
msgstr "协议类型。只接受 `oidc`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`display_name`"
msgstr "`display_name`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "The name users see when they link or confirm with this provider"
msgstr "用户在关联账号或确认身份时看到的名称"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`enabled`"
msgstr "`enabled`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`true`"
msgstr "`true`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Set `false` to stop offering the provider. Existing links are kept"
msgstr "设为 `false` 后不再提供这个身份提供方。已有的关联会保留"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`issuer`"
msgstr "`issuer`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"The provider's issuer URL, exactly as its discovery document states it. "
"It must use `https`; `http` is accepted for `localhost` only"
msgstr ""
"身份提供方的 issuer URL，必须和它的 discovery 文档中写的完全一致。必须使用 `https`；只有 `localhost` "
"可以用 `http`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`client_id`, `client_secret`"
msgstr "`client_id`, `client_secret`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`client_secret` is always a `${NAME}` reference to a secret setting, "
"never the secret itself"
msgstr "`client_secret` 永远是指向某个密钥设置的 `${NAME}` 引用，不能直接写密钥"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`client_auth_method`"
msgstr "`client_auth_method`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`client_secret_basic`"
msgstr "`client_secret_basic`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"How the gateway authenticates to the token endpoint. The other value is "
"`client_secret_post`"
msgstr "网关向 token 接口证明自己身份的方式。另一个取值是 `client_secret_post`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`scopes`"
msgstr "`scopes`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`[\"openid\", \"email\", \"profile\"]`"
msgstr "`[\"openid\", \"email\", \"profile\"]`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Must include `openid`"
msgstr "必须包含 `openid`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`required_claims`"
msgstr "`required_claims`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{}`"
msgstr "`{}`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"Claims the ID token must carry, each with exactly the value given. See "
"[Issuers that several organizations share](#issuers-that-several-"
"organizations-share)"
msgstr ""
"ID token 里必须带的 claim，值要与这里写的完全相同。参见[多个机构共用的 issuer](#issuers-that-"
"several-organizations-share)"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`domains`"
msgstr "`domains`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"The email domains this provider answers for. `example.edu` matches that "
"domain; `*.example.edu` matches its subdomains and not `example.edu` "
"itself. Two providers cannot claim the same domain"
msgstr ""
"这个身份提供方负责的邮箱域名。`example.edu` 只匹配该域名本身；`*.example.edu` 匹配它的子域名，不匹配 "
"`example.edu` 本身。两个身份提供方不能声明同一个域名"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`assume_email_verified`"
msgstr "`assume_email_verified`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`false`"
msgstr "`false`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"Treat the provider's email as verified although the provider does not say"
" so"
msgstr "即使身份提供方没有说明邮箱已验证，也把它的邮箱视为已验证"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`auto_create`"
msgstr "`auto_create`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Create an account at a member's first sign-in"
msgstr "成员第一次登录时创建账号"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`require_approval`"
msgstr "`require_approval`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Put an account created that way in the approval queue"
msgstr "这样创建的账号先进入审批队列"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`auto_link`"
msgstr "`auto_link`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Link an existing account that has the same email without asking its owner"
msgstr "已有同邮箱的账号时，不询问账号主人就直接关联"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`default_role`"
msgstr "`default_role`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`free`"
msgstr "`free`"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Role of an account created at first sign-in: `free`, `pro` or `internal`"
msgstr "第一次登录时创建的账号的角色：`free`、`pro` 或 `internal`"

#: ../developer/sso.md:76
msgid "What a sign-in does"
msgstr "一次登录会发生什么"

#: ../developer/sso.md:78
msgid ""
"The gateway identifies a member by the provider's identifier for them, "
"not by email. Once that identifier is linked to an account, the member "
"signs in to it whatever email the provider reports later. For an "
"identifier not linked yet, the gateway trusts the email only if it is in "
"one of the provider's `domains` and the provider reports it verified (or "
"`assume_email_verified` is on); otherwise the sign-in is refused. Then:"
msgstr ""
"网关按提供方给成员的标识符来识别成员，而不是按邮箱。该标识符一旦关联到某个账号，无论提供方之后报告什么邮箱，成员都登录到这个账号。对于尚未关联的标识符，只有当邮箱属于提供方的某个"
" `domains`，且提供方报告该邮箱已验证（或开启了 "
"`assume_email_verified`）时，网关才信任这个邮箱；否则拒绝登录。之后："

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Account with that email"
msgstr "使用该邮箱的账号"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "None, and `auto_create` is off"
msgstr "没有，且 `auto_create` 关闭"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "The sign-in is refused"
msgstr "拒绝登录"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "None, and `auto_create` is on"
msgstr "没有，且 `auto_create` 打开"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"An account is created with `default_role`. With `require_approval` it "
"waits in **Admin → Users** like any registration"
msgstr ""
"用 `default_role` 创建账号。打开 `require_approval` 时，它和普通注册一样在 **Admin → Users**"
" 中等待审批"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Exists and is active"
msgstr "存在且处于活动状态"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "The member signs in to it once, the usual way, and accepts the link"
msgstr "成员先用平常的方式登录该账号一次，再接受关联"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Exists and is not active"
msgstr "存在但不处于活动状态"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"The sign-in is refused. A deleted account's email stays taken, as for "
"signup"
msgstr "拒绝登录。已删除账号的邮箱仍然被占用，与注册时相同"

#: ../developer/sso.md:92
msgid ""
"Creating accounts this way ignores the public signup switch and the "
"signup allowlist, but never creates an account for an address on "
"`ADMIN_EMAILS`. To let every member in at their first sign-in, set "
"`\"auto_create\": true` and `\"require_approval\": false`."
msgstr ""
"以这种方式创建账号不受公开注册开关和注册白名单的限制，但绝不会为 `ADMIN_EMAILS` "
"中的地址创建账号。要让每位成员首次登录即可使用，请设置 `\"auto_create\": true` 和 "
"`\"require_approval\": false`。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:97
msgid "Link existing accounts without asking"
msgstr "不询问就关联已有账号"

#: ../developer/sso.md:99
msgid ""
"With `auto_link` on, an active account with the same email is linked at "
"once when the deployment requires email verification, the account's email"
" is verified, and the account is not an administrator. Leave it off if "
"the deployment has ever run without email verification (accounts "
"registered then were marked verified without proof), or if the "
"organization reassigns email addresses (a new member would get the "
"previous holder's account)."
msgstr ""
"开启 `auto_link` "
"后，当部署要求邮箱验证、账号邮箱已验证且账号不是管理员时，邮箱相同的活跃账号会被立即关联。以下两种情况请保持关闭：部署曾在不要求邮箱验证的情况下运行过（那段时间注册的账号未经验证就被标记为已验证）；或者组织会把邮箱地址重新分配给别人（新成员会拿到前任持有者的账号）。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:106
msgid "Providers that do not report a verified email"
msgstr "不报告邮箱已验证的身份提供方"

#: ../developer/sso.md:108
msgid ""
"Some providers, Microsoft Entra ID among them, never send "
"`email_verified`. If the organization manages its own addresses, set "
"`assume_email_verified` to `true` for that provider; otherwise no member "
"can complete a first sign-in."
msgstr ""
"有些提供方从不发送 `email_verified`，Microsoft Entra ID 就是其中之一。如果组织自己管理邮箱地址，请为该提供方把"
" `assume_email_verified` 设为 `true`；否则没有成员能完成首次登录。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:112
msgid "Issuers that several organizations share"
msgstr "多个机构共用的 issuer"

#: ../developer/sso.md:114
msgid ""
"Some providers sign in every organization's accounts at one issuer. At "
"Google, an organization account and a personal account both come from "
"`https://accounts.google.com`, and a personal account can carry a "
"verified email in your domain. Require the claim that names the "
"organization, and a sign-in whose ID token lacks it is refused:"
msgstr ""
"有些提供方在同一个 issuer 下登录所有组织的账号。在 Google，组织账号和个人账号都来自 "
"`https://accounts.google.com`，而个人账号也可能带有你所在域的已验证邮箱。请要求提供表明所属组织的 claim，ID "
"token 中缺少它的登录会被拒绝："

#: ../developer/sso.md:124
msgid ""
"For Google the claim is `hd`, the organization's primary domain. A member"
" signs in only through the provider they were linked through, so a "
"provider's `required_claims` and `enabled` switch hold for all of its "
"members."
msgstr ""
"对 Google 而言，这个 claim 是 `hd`，即组织的主域名。成员只能通过当初关联的提供方登录，因此提供方的 "
"`required_claims` 和 `enabled` 开关对它的所有成员都生效。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:128
msgid "Linking and unlinking"
msgstr "关联与解除关联"

#: ../developer/sso.md:130
msgid ""
"Users connect and disconnect organization accounts under **Settings → "
"Single sign-on**; both ask them to confirm, and the only way to sign in "
"to an account cannot be disconnected. The organization account's email "
"may differ from the account's, but it cannot be another account's email: "
"the user signs in to that account and connects there."
msgstr ""
"用户在 **Settings → Single sign-on** "
"中连接和断开组织账号；两者都需要用户确认，而账号唯一的登录方式无法断开。组织账号的邮箱可以与本账号不同，但不能是另一个账号的邮箱：此时用户应登录那个账号并在那里连接。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:136
msgid ""
"An administrator sees a user's links in the user's detail panel under "
"**Admin → Users** and can unlink one, but cannot create one. Unlinking "
"removes the link only; it does not end sessions or revoke API keys. A "
"sign-in refused because the account is linked to a different identity "
"from the same organization means the provider recreated the member or "
"gave the address to someone else; confirm which, then unlink the old "
"identity."
msgstr ""
"管理员可以在 **Admin → Users** "
"的用户详情面板中看到用户的关联，并可以解除某个关联，但不能替用户创建关联。解除关联只删除关联本身，不会结束会话，也不会吊销 API "
"key。如果登录因账号已关联到同一组织的另一个身份而被拒绝，说明提供方重建了该成员，或把这个地址给了别人；先确认是哪种情况，再解除旧身份的关联。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:143
msgid "Confirming sensitive actions"
msgstr "确认敏感操作"

#: ../developer/sso.md:145
msgid ""
"An account created by single sign-on has no password. When its owner "
"deletes the account, sets a password or changes the sign-in email, the "
"console sends them to the provider to sign in again."
msgstr "通过 SSO 创建的账号没有密码。账号所有者删除账号、设置密码或修改登录邮箱时，控制台会把他们送到提供方重新登录。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:149
msgid ""
"An administrator confirms a security-relevant change in **Admin** with a "
"code from the account's authenticator app, or with the account's "
"password. An administrator who signs in only through a provider, with no "
"password and no verified phone, signs in at the provider again instead; "
"each sign-in confirms one change in the same session within five minutes."
" An account with a verified phone but no password must set a password "
"under **Settings** first, and adding an authenticator app also needs a "
"password."
msgstr ""
"管理员在 **Admin** "
"中确认涉及安全的修改时，使用账号身份验证器应用中的验证码，或使用账号密码。只通过提供方登录、既没有密码也没有已验证手机号的管理员，改为在提供方重新登录；每次登录可在同一会话内、五分钟之内确认一项修改。有已验证手机号但没有密码的账号，必须先在"
" **Settings** 中设置密码；添加身份验证器应用同样需要密码。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:157
msgid "When a member leaves the organization"
msgstr "成员离开机构时"

#: ../developer/sso.md:159
msgid ""
"The gateway is not told when a provider disables an account. The member "
"can no longer sign in through the provider, but open sessions and API "
"keys keep working. Suspend the account in **Admin → Users** to end both."
msgstr ""
"提供方停用某个账号时，网关不会收到通知。该成员无法再通过提供方登录，但已打开的会话和 API key 仍然有效。在 **Admin → "
"Users** 中停用该账号即可同时终止两者。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:163
msgid "Stop offering a provider"
msgstr "停止提供某个身份提供方"

#: ../developer/sso.md:165
msgid ""
"Set `enabled` to `false`. Accounts that sign in only through that "
"provider can then set a password with **Forgot password**, which needs "
"outgoing email; without it, set their passwords before you disable the "
"provider. Removing the provider from `SSO_PROVIDERS` keeps its members "
"out too, and their links stay. A provider with the same issuer takes over"
" a link only when its `domains` cover the email the link was made with. "
"Changing a provider's `issuer` breaks every existing link to it, because "
"links are recorded against the issuer."
msgstr ""
"将 `enabled` 设为 `false`。只通过该提供方登录的账号此后可以用 **Forgot password** "
"设置密码，这需要配置外发邮件；没有外发邮件时，请在停用提供方之前为这些账号设置密码。从 `SSO_PROVIDERS` "
"中删除提供方同样会把它的成员挡在外面，但他们的关联会保留。只有当另一个 issuer 相同的提供方的 `domains` "
"覆盖关联时所用的邮箱，它才会接管这个关联。修改提供方的 `issuer` 会使它现有的所有关联失效，因为关联是按 issuer 记录的。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:173
msgid "Try it with a local provider"
msgstr "用本地的身份提供方试一试"

#: ../developer/sso.md:175
msgid ""
"Run the gateway from a [development checkout](installation.md"
"#development-checkout-no-docker), so that `localhost` means the same "
"machine to your browser and the gateway, and start "
"[Keycloak](https://www.keycloak.org/) on another port:"
msgstr ""
"从[开发检出](installation.md#development-checkout-no-docker)运行网关，让 `localhost`"
" 对浏览器和网关来说都指向同一台机器，然后在另一个端口上启动 [Keycloak](https://www.keycloak.org/)："

#: ../developer/sso.md:186
msgid ""
"In the Keycloak admin console at `http://localhost:8081`, create a realm,"
" a user with a verified email and a password, and an OpenID Connect "
"client with client authentication on and the redirect URI "
"`<FRONTEND_URL>/auth/sso/keycloak/callback`. Then add a provider with "
"`id` `keycloak`, `issuer` `http://localhost:8081/realms/<realm>` and "
"`domains` covering the user's email, store the client secret, restart the"
" gateway, and sign in with **Log in with SSO**."
msgstr ""
"在 `http://localhost:8081` 的 Keycloak 管理控制台中，创建一个 "
"realm、一个有已验证邮箱和密码的用户，以及一个开启客户端认证、回调地址为 "
"`<FRONTEND_URL>/auth/sso/keycloak/callback` 的 OpenID Connect "
"客户端。然后添加一个提供方：`id` 为 `keycloak`，`issuer` 为 "
"`http://localhost:8081/realms/<realm>`，`domains` 覆盖该用户的邮箱；存好 client "
"secret，重启网关，再用 **Log in with SSO** 登录。"

#: ../developer/sso.md:194
msgid "When a sign-in is refused"
msgstr "登录被拒绝时"

#: ../developer/sso.md:196
msgid ""
"The sign-in page shows a short message. The gateway's log names the "
"provider and the reason, and never contains a token or a secret."
msgstr "登录页会显示一条简短的提示。网关日志会写明是哪个身份提供方以及原因，日志里不会出现 token 或密钥。"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Message says"
msgstr "提示内容"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Usual cause"
msgstr "常见原因"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Single sign-on is unavailable"
msgstr "SSO 登录暂时不可用"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"The provider cannot be reached, the client secret setting is empty, the "
"gateway has not restarted since the secret was stored, or `FRONTEND_URL` "
"is not an absolute URL"
msgstr "连不上身份提供方，client secret 设置为空，保存密钥之后网关还没有重启，或者 `FRONTEND_URL` 不是绝对地址"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "The sign-in took too long"
msgstr "登录已超时"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"The user took more than ten minutes, opened the callback in another "
"browser, or reached the console through an address other than "
"`FRONTEND_URL`. Every sign-in ends this way when the console calls the "
"gateway on another host and `COOKIE_DOMAIN` does not cover both: see step"
" 6 of [Connect a provider](#connect-a-provider). A link from **Settings**"
" also ends this way when the user signed out before it completed"
msgstr ""
"用户用了超过十分钟，在另一个浏览器里打开了回调地址，或者通过 `FRONTEND_URL` "
"以外的地址访问控制台。如果控制台通过另一个主机访问网关，而 `COOKIE_DOMAIN` "
"没有同时覆盖这两个主机，每一次登录都会这样结束：参见[对接一个身份提供方](#connect-a-provider)的第 6 步。在 "
"**Settings** 里发起的关联，如果用户在完成之前退出了登录，也会这样结束"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Too many sign-in attempts"
msgstr "登录尝试过于频繁"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"More than 120 sign-ins were started from one client address in an hour. "
"Behind a reverse proxy the gateway sees the proxy's address for every "
"browser, and all of them share that allowance, until it is told which "
"proxies to trust: see [Trusted Proxies and Client IPs](trusted-proxies-"
"and-client-ips.md)"
msgstr ""
"一小时内从同一个客户端地址发起了超过 120 "
"次登录。网关在反向代理后面时，看到的每个浏览器都是代理的地址，所有浏览器共用这一个额度，直到配置了可信代理为止：见[可信代理与客户端 IP"
"](trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md)"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Single sign-on failed"
msgstr "SSO 登录失败"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"The provider's answer did not validate, the account lacks a claim that "
"`required_claims` asks for, or the member was linked through another "
"provider that has the same issuer"
msgstr ""
"身份提供方的回答没有通过校验，账号没有 `required_claims` 要求的 claim，或者成员是通过 issuer "
"相同的另一个身份提供方关联的"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "The email could not be confirmed"
msgstr "无法确认邮箱"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid ""
"The email is outside the provider's `domains`, or the provider does not "
"report it as verified"
msgstr "邮箱不在该身份提供方的 `domains` 内，或者身份提供方没有报告它已验证"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "No account here yet"
msgstr "还没有对应的平台账号"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "`auto_create` is off, or the address is on `ADMIN_EMAILS`"
msgstr "`auto_create` 关闭，或者该地址在 `ADMIN_EMAILS` 中"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Pending approval"
msgstr "等待审批"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "The account was created and waits in **Admin → Users**"
msgstr "账号已创建，正在 **Admin → Users** 中等待审批"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "Already connected to a different identity"
msgstr "已经关联了另一个身份"

#: ../developer/sso.md
msgid "See [Linking and unlinking](#linking-and-unlinking)"
msgstr "参见[关联与解除关联](#linking-and-unlinking)"

